    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Here's a surprise. Stars don't really twinkle! It's our air that makes them look that way.",
      "punch": "air",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🌍",
        "text": "It's our air!",
        "cue": "air",
        "sub": "Stars shine steady",
        "sub_cue": "stars"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "The air? How?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Starlight travels a super long way through space to reach us. At the very end, it has to pass through the air around Earth.",
      "board": {
        "type": "journey",
        "title": "Starlight's trip",
        "traveler": "✨",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "⭐",
            "label": "Starlight",
            "cue": "starlight"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🌌",
            "label": "Through space",
            "cue": "space"
          },
          {
            "icon": "💨",
            "label": "Our air",
            "cue": "air"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🌍",
            "label": "Earth",
            "cue": "earth"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Our air is always moving, with warm and cool bits swirling around. They bend the light a tiny bit, this way and that.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "💨",
        "text": "Moving air bends light",
        "cue": "bend",
        "sub": "Warm and cool swirls",
        "sub_cue": "warm"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So the light wobbles?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Exactly! The light wobbles, so the star looks like it's flickering. That's the twinkle!",
      "punch": "twinkle",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "✨",
        "text": "Wobbly light = twinkle",
        "cue": "twinkle",
        "sub": "Flicker, flicker!",
        "sub_cue": "flickering"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Do planets twinkle too?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Stars are so far away, they look like tiny dots. Planets are much closer to us, so they usually twinkle less.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "Stars",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Super far",
              "icon": "🔭",
